===Question #12===
{{Cquote2|Right now in SOTN, killing the boss before the Smite phase causes it to bug out. Will this bug be addressed?}}

[https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=c1w4LJiW-7I&t=2508s Youtube Time Stamp]

