* '''Mod Arcane:''' No.
* '''Mod Ayiza:''' Are we going to change it? This wasn’t in our feedback.
* '''Mod Arcane:''' No, I think we're just gonna leave it. It's nice to be able to AFK that phase. It makes you feel like a God, dodging everything around you like Neo.
